    <string name="restart_systemui_title">Restart System UI</string>
    <string name="restart_systemui_summary">Uses root to restart System UI only. Status bar blinks 1–2 seconds; the phone is not rebooted.</string>
    <string name="restart_systemui_dialog_title">Restart System UI?</string>
    <string name="restart_systemui_dialog_body1">Root will run a hardcoded command that only crashes System UI and its plugin. system_server relaunches the status bar. The phone is not rebooted and no other process is touched.</string>
    <string name="restart_systemui_dialog_body2">Magisk / KernelSU may ask for permission the first time. Grant this app only. If you deny, nothing is executed.</string>
    <string name="restart_systemui_dialog_body3">The command is fixed to am crash com.android.systemui and com.vivo.systemuiplugin. No extra arguments are concatenated.</string>
